## Evidence

The obsolete replacement-icon function and the VWJ fallback validator have been
removed after proving they had no remaining product consumers. Earlier cleanup
also retired the external Python language tool, `src/mods/languages`, and other
superseded compatibility paths without reintroducing them as workspace members.

